   '2025-11-01', null, '2026-10-16T00:00:00Z', '13a98f575b75d3aadfcab725e0bb9f98d6863ce89e9beb00c9bb52632b40ff7d', 'extracted', 'unreviewed', 'Date basis: the DA PAM 611-21 (Smartbook) cover reads "End of Fiscal Year 2025 … November 2025"; no day is stated, so the 1st is used. The chapter was posted on api.army.mil on 2025-12-04. Individual specifications carry their own effective dates (e.g. "Effective 202610"); those are stored per passage, not per source. The officer chapter describes each AOC in general; it is not written by grade. Grade ranges come from the structure chart in the same chapter. LIMITATIONS: AOCs whose section has no "Description of duties" item (listed in the report) have no description here; qualification, special-qualification and physical-demand items are skipped as requirements.', 'pdf-parse 2.4.5', 'army-611-21-officer-ch3@2026-10-16', 'ce1c603aa3fdbe4c4f4fdf133d21d0db8be197e03bb950772f052565ec3d0ebe')
