(b) Commander Special Operations Company (SRC 11700R), 55 th Combat Camera Company (SRC 11693R), Commander 514 th Signal Company (SRC 11647R), and Commander', 'adef0abd5759cf8dabd56dabf7c96a37e7c8b5fcf4ce3fc7f0d73616875eb506', 56, 56, null, 33, null, null, false, null),
