  ('36d4aa66-623c-53f2-a8fb-d8237741a241', '7a6a4906-e811-5fb6-97fc-206842efb40c', 'Army', 'officer', '26Z', 'DATA NETWORK ENGINEERING', 'general_duties', null, null, 'Description of duties', 'DA PAM 611-21, ch. 3 (officer branches and functional areas)', 'Leads, manages, directs, network systems and information systems activities at the executive level. The AOC 26Z designation is awarded to all FA 26 officers upon promotion to the rank of COL. 2) Specialized grading of positions. Authorized at the grade of COL. 3) Unique duty positions.
