  ('cc729d5f-e928-59ed-a85d-ab6a9b389c6b', '7a6a4906-e811-5fb6-97fc-206842efb40c', 'Army', 'officer', '48J', 'AFRICA, SOUTH OF THE SAHARA', 'grades_authorized', null, null, 'Special grading of positions', 'DA PAM 611-21, ch. 3 (officer branches and functional areas)', 'Positions graded MAJ and above. Select billets may be coded for:
